{"path":"header/debugging","title":"Standard library header <debugging> (C++26)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;debugging&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/debugging","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header is part of the diagnostics library.","html":"<p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/error\">diagnostics</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Functions\">Functions</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/breakpoint\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>breakpoint</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  pauses the running program when called <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/breakpoint_if_debugging\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>breakpoint_if_debugging</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calls <span class=\"t-lc\">std::breakpoint</span> if <span class=\"t-lc\">std::is_debugger_present</span> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/is_debugger_present\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>is_debugger_present</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(C++26)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether a program is running under the control of a debugger <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co1\">// all freestanding</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// debugging utility</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> breakpoint<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> breakpoint_if_debugging<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_debugger_present<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Synopsis","id":"Synopsis"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"header","title":"C++ Standard Library headers"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Standard library header <debugging> (C++26)","children":[{"label":"Functions","children":[{"label":"breakpoint","note":"pauses the running program when called"},{"label":"breakpoint_if_debugging","note":"calls std::breakpoint if std::is_debugger_present returns true"},{"label":"is_debugger_present","note":"checks whether a program is running under the control of a debugger"}]},{"label":"Synopsis"}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":59,"codeBlockCount":1}
